cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use FluxMMM in research or industry work, please cite the software and working paper."
title: "FluxMMM and RegretSet-MMM: Relative Log-Regret Selection of Bayesian Marketing Mix Models"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Bramao
    given-names: Gustavo
version: 5.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-12
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/gustavobramao/fluxmmm"
url: "https://fluxmmm-web.web.app/"
abstract: >-
  A local-first marketing mix modeling workflow and frozen set-wise selector
  trained on uncapped relative log-regret. RegretSet-MMM combines posterior,
  evidence, validation, specification, business-context, and candidate-relative
  tokens to reduce downstream economic decision regret.
keywords:
  - marketing mix modeling
  - Bayesian calibration
  - causal inference
  - posterior sampling
  - media optimization
  - decision-focused learning
  - economic regret
  - variational inference
